Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, didn't budge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that punch has some\Ndecent force behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.45,0:00:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this guy for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could give Nanami a run for his\Nmoney in terms of physical power,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.57,0:00:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though I suppose that's why It\Nmakes sense that it's a sturdy veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to search for its\Nweak point and put a hole in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.39,0:00:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if it's only for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.15,0:00:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't get anywhere\Nwithout getting inside first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.69,0:00:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.87,0:00:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, this is a veil\Nthat keeps sorcerers out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a major barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.05,0:00:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barriers are all designed to\Nsurround you and protect you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.57,0:00:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which fundamentally means that whoever\Nlowered this veil is inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.73,0:00:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and being protected by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but back in Harajuku...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.99,0:01:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.75,0:01:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So staying outside the Veil instead\Nof surrounding themselves with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Increases the risk of being\Ndiscovered and defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.17,0:01:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but in return, the Veil's\Nstrength increases.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.43,0:01:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a real Egg of Columbus\Nidea. Huh? Whose egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though, man, they're completely\Nignoring the fundamentals of barriers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.23,0:01:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a crazy idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.09,0:01:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can see why the barrier didn't\Nbreak, despite how hard Yuji hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.93,0:01:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to that logic,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.59,0:01:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the veil's source should be somewhere\Nrather obvious to us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.23,0:01:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The payoff for the increased risk of\Nbeing seen is a much more powerful veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.58,0:01:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stands out?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.48,0:01:52.98,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnArial\bord0\shad0\b1\pos(320,300)}22:01 Shibuya Central Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think the sorcerers will realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.27,0:02:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the place that\Nstands out the most, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume so yeah but even\Nif they do realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.05,0:02:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah the lower poles are swarming\Nwith those transfigured humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't be able to\Nclimb up here fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A wire? These are great.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.29,0:02:31.50,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(208,0)\pos(92,36)\fs18\bord1\shad0\c&H716DA4&\3c&HF3E5EE&}These are great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.07,0:02:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.05,0:02:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.45,0:02:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do these bastards
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know about the other fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.03,0:02:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good just as planned so\Nthis must be the source
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.47,0:02:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the veil yeah may may\Ntold me it already has.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The barrier programmed\Ninto the center of it it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.89,0:02:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just needs someone to pour\Ncursed energy into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:03:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To start its activation\Nwhich means as long as we
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,destroy those things we\Ncan ignore the curse users.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.37,0:03:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until later there were\Nthree of them the veil
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keeping sorcery sound is\Nstill active where are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.51,0:03:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the remaining two?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? With him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro! Dismiss Nue!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.23,0:03:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandson, yeah I know what to do, Granny.\NI'm leading some impressionable kids now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's time for me to\Nearn some achievements here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.91,0:03:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as well then i can become\Na first grade sorcerer too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.85,0:04:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.09,0:04:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.89,0:04:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see the moment of impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But his body's undamaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.43,0:04:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he is a sorcerer, he still\Nplummeted from the City floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up now, you old trickster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.61,0:04:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.19,0:04:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, these youngsters today\Nhave no pity for the elderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.33,0:04:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't waste time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.75,0:04:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't take us long.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.02,0:04:45.02,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Episode 35\N{\fs30\fscy150}Seance
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.58,0:05:00.09,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,825)\pos(320,10)\3c&H8ECEDD&}JUJUTSU KAISEN\N{\fs16\bord0\fscy100\c&HDEDCE0&}Shibuya Incident
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a love song.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.39,0:05:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.31,0:05:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a love song.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.87,0:05:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a love song.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.35,0:05:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a love song.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.79,0:05:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.99,0:06:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you so insistent\Non my recommendation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.49,0:06:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could easily become semi-first-grade\Nwith your technique without a word for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I believe it's important\Nto do things the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.65,0:06:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially with bloody\Nwork like being a sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.63,0:06:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not that bright, so sometimes\NI don't know what the right way is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.43,0:06:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So whenever I'm at a\Nloss, I think to myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would Nanami do in this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be right to become a\Nfirst grade without your approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, would you like another drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.35,0:06:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Mok Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Auspicious Beast Summon, number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.65,0:07:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's homing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.77,0:07:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Seance Technique\NAuspicious Beast Summon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.45,0:07:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By hiding his face,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eno can become a spiritual medium used to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,manifest the powers of the\Nfour auspicious beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granny, that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.19,0:07:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, quite the coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.13,0:07:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number two, Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.05,0:07:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nanami entrusted those two to me,\Nso I can't just leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it would be a bad idea\Nto leave these guys to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best option is to kill them\Nfast and rejoin my underclassmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adapt to the facts. And maintain self.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Control. Cast aside pride. Fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.83,0:08:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matching pace with him takes more\Neffort than fighting the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.57,0:08:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Itadori! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.87,0:09:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.87,0:09:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So full of life, what promising futures?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Definitely worth killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon Dog's claws can\Nhurt even special grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.97,0:09:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hit him with serious force, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.39,0:09:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not damaged at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.57,0:09:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you told me this\Nwouldn't take us long.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.23,0:09:35.73,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\frz282.5\pos(76.666,183.333)\fnComic Sans MS\c&H1D1618&\3c&HF4F8FA&\bord1}No comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.35,0:09:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.85,0:09:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just as he seems.\NNot all that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.19,0:09:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's doing whatever it takes and\Nsacrificing himself to protect that old hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.39,0:10:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something more to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.97,0:10:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.95,0:10:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their horrors changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all set, grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.77,0:10:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it, Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.51,0:10:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.11,0:10:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toji Zenin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.89,0:10:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how is it grandson yeah it's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,great granny better than any before
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.31,0:10:51.11,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\fad(1350,0)\1c&H75EFED&\3c&H75EFED&\blur20\1a&HE0&\3a&HC0&\pos(320,18)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.37,0:10:51.08,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\fad(1350,0)\1a&HFF&\3c&HC5E3EC&\pos(320,18)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.31,0:10:56.07,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\fad(675,0)\3c&H1EDDF0&\pos(320,18)\c&H292619&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.07,0:11:03.07,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\bord0\shad0\b1\pos(320,20)}December 7th, 1989
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.83,0:11:13.84,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\bord0\shad0\b1\pos(320,20)}Satoru Gojo Is Born
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.01,0:11:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.35,0:11:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your present's seeing me in my uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it the most adorable\Nschool uniform ever, Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad I went\Nwith Mori High. After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.85,0:11:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're happy, I'm happy,\Nbut you start out with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much confidence you're gonna turn\Nout just like your mother huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.31,0:11:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you hate mom or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no I don't hate her but she
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.65,0:11:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did cheat on me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.57,0:11:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.95,0:11:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know my poor Papa
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:12:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.77,0:12:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her I need
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a corpse in order to transform
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.23,0:12:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into someone I've summoned
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.51,0:12:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,although it didn't make any
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.31,0:12:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,difference to me she screamed\Nfor her mother when she died?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.23,0:12:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.89,0:12:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no good to me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.80,0:12:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looks like I I ripped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you to please\Nlet me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.95,0:12:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.31,0:12:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.97,0:12:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have I ever done\Nto you to deserve this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.95,0:12:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My job is killing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.37,0:12:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I need to really understand\Nhow the human body works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.73,0:13:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were once free Jujutsu
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.99,0:13:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorcerers had their hands full
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the increasing number of\Ncurses as long as we did things
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.89,0:13:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right we could easily earn the\Nliving without being tied down
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.45,0:13:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by anything we curse users were\Nfree to live and do as we pleased
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.21,0:13:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,satoru gojo yes the child born to the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.19,0:13:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gojo clan with the six\Neyes a kid the total
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.43,0:13:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bounty on his head is already over 100\Nmillion yen oh and this isn't a request
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.53,0:13:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's first come first serve
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.07,0:13:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.93,0:14:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cursed spirits have been\Ngrowing stronger over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.11,0:14:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in that instant, I\Nunderstood exactly why!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of him, Satoru Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the same as when an insurmountable
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.67,0:14:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,track and field record\Nwas suddenly broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.97,0:14:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same as when figure\Nskaters started adding
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.59,0:14:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more revolutions to their\Njumps due to one athlete.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.23,0:14:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The balance of the world changed\Nwhen Satoru Gojo was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:14:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit looking at me, weakling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.77,0:15:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.31,0:15:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in our later years...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.49,0:15:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That freedom was stolen from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.87,0:15:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never stop trying\Nto get our freedom back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.03,0:15:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tremble over the weekend\Nto the very day I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what is with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.37,0:15:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not even about him\Nbeing tough anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.89,0:15:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost certainly the\Nresult of his technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damage nullification?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.07,0:15:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.09,0:15:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru Gojo is here in Shibuya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.89,0:16:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave the Veil Foundations\Nand run while you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a lousy bluff that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.43,0:16:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gojo has been sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.25,0:16:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were the one shouting\Nfrom the rooftop so loudly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.03,0:16:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we're out here\Nhaving fun, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Gojo was still active,\Nwe'd be at home sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.11,0:16:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.15,0:16:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could be Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.01,0:16:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro, you suck at lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.21,0:16:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means this guy's technique can't\Nbe something as grand as nullification.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.31,0:16:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay? Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.43,0:16:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to fight anymore,\Njust tell me and I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.05,0:16:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rabbit escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.23,0:17:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fall back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.99,0:17:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally figured out his technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.29,0:17:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Transformation through seance?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.55,0:17:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That head is a medium?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not the problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.59,0:17:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.05,0:17:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he some famous sorcerer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell by his stance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.03,0:17:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's Hall strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.09,0:17:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number four, Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.43,0:17:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The type of Shikigami that\Ndistracts with numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.99,0:18:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they're planning to launch a lethal\Nattack from the cover of these hairs, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.57,0:18:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.47,0:18:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Max Elephant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.37,0:18:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell is this? Appearing and\Ndisappearing... What are you restless?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.21,0:18:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're a man, be clear and decisive.\NNot my style, but I'll let my friend know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.37,0:18:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is with this brat's incredible power?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.45,0:18:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's giving me chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.11,0:18:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, just keep attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.81,0:18:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's engine is getting\Npretty revved up too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.01,0:19:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A finishing blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.73,0:19:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My technique is inverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.77,0:19:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While activated, the stronger the\Nattacks, the weaker they feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.77,0:19:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the weaker the attacks,\Nthe stronger they become.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.89,0:19:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not one person has ever\Nmanaged to dodge my
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,counterattack after landing\Ntheir finishing blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.43,0:19:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more serious you two get, the\Nless chance you have against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.13,0:19:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally figured out his technique. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure it's an inverse technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.17,0:19:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My out-of-sync attack landed more\Neffectively than your direct one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rabbit escape isn't meant for offense,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.77,0:19:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he didn't try to immediately\Nbreak through once he was surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.03,0:20:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the fact that\Nhe's fine after being
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beaten into the ground\Nalso supports my theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.33,0:20:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we can defeat him\Nwith a forehead flick?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.99,0:20:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, the attack can't be too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it was just pure inversion of force,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.07,0:20:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,activating it in something as simple\Nas a light breeze would kill him.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.09,0:20:17.04,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(175,250)\fnComic Sans MS\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord1\pos(77.333,82)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.71,0:20:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since that isn't happening, there must be\Nan upper and lower limit to his inversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.45,0:20:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even with it activated,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.63,0:20:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he countered our attacks\Nand used cursed energy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.81,0:20:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for protection from the\Neffects of our techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.67,0:20:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.39,0:20:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That also explains why he's\Nafraid of an anomaly like Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.89,0:20:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His technique's probably a bad\Nmatch against complex techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.37,0:20:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means we need to strike together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.79,0:20:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll hit him with a powerful\Nattack and a weaker one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.93,0:20:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.65,0:20:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, but we don't want him to realize\Nwe've figured out his technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.77,0:20:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we'll keep going at full power and\Nmake a show of our crazy strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.77,0:21:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll start with a weak blow from Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.39,0:21:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll pummel him with a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.01,0:21:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they figure it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.31,0:21:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.83,0:21:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No goody for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You figured out my technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.03,0:21:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky, you BRATS!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stopped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.59,0:21:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed his momentum for just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.57,0:22:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're surprisingly adept, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.71,0:22:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.71,0:22:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.59,0:23:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to believe in yourself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.41,0:23:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.45,0:23:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to believe in yourself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.59,0:23:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.03,0:23:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And give it more than once?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.13,0:23:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it more than once!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.38,0:23:55.05,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\blur4}Next Episode\N{\fs30\fscy150}Blunt Knife

